\"clear: both;\"><div style=\"clear: both;\"><br /></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><div style=\"clear: both;\"><div style=\"clear: both;\"><br /></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">雲&nbsp; &nbsp; 谷<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/10/blog-post_4.html\" target=\"_blank\">渡鳥</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>1</span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">袖&nbsp; &nbsp; 子<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/10/tng-uat.html\" target=\"_blank\">行踏　tńg-uat拄著……</a></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">2</span></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br /></span></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">呂美親<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/10/blog-post_38.html\" target=\"_blank\">和緯路四段速寫</a></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">3</span></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br /></span></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">張日東<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/10/blog-post_57.html\" target=\"_blank\">燈仔花</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>4</span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">吳玉祥<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/10/gong-hooe.html\" target=\"_blank\">Gōng囝</a></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/10/gong-hooe.html\" target=\"_blank\">——送hōo《大疫》所有ê工作人員</a></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">6</span></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br /></span></span></div><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阿瑞--ā話仙</span></h3><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">藍春瑞<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/10/e_11.html\" target=\"_blank\">Ē吵--無？</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>9</span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">心內話</span></h3><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阿&nbsp; &nbsp; 表<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/10/ema-e-hoo.html\" target=\"_blank\">透血ê語言mā ē hōo人快樂</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>10</span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">朱淑君<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/10/tehe.html\" target=\"_blank\">學習台文真正是teh走揣家己ê喙舌</a><br />13</span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">鄭雁馨<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/10/e_96.html\" target=\"_blank\">原來台語聲調是有規則--ê！</a><br />15</span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Chhî Bēng-ûn<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/10/20.html\" target=\"_blank\">來台北20冬記念</a><br />43</span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">生活ê藝術</span></h3><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">戴秀娟<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/10/hoo-e.html\" target=\"_blank\">寮仔hōo阮--ê</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>16</span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">鄭秀女<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/10/blog-post_11.html\" target=\"_blank\">阮兜</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>19</span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">陳榮廷<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/10/e_82.html\" target=\"_blank\">食老ê閒仔話</a><br />21</span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">逐家來phò-tāu</span></h3><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">陳錦月<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/10/blog-post_34.html\" target=\"_blank\">閃著腰</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>25</span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">李天群<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/10/e_30.html\" target=\"_blank\">卵塔ê記持</a><br />28</span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">棲地復育台語講座</span></h3><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">主講／蘇銀添</span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">記錄／王璽馮<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/10/blog-post_65.html\" target=\"_blank\">鱟來平安</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>31</span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Lán來講看māi</span></h3><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">王大維、吳玉祥<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/10/ekah.html\" target=\"_blank\">地動ê島嶼kah都市更新</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>34</span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Sann-kap讀小說</span></h3><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">陳智銘<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/10/e_12.html\" target=\"_blank\">我ê朋友</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>36</span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">李淑貞<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/10/tibehe.html\" target=\"_blank\">行！Tī日頭beh落山ê時（一）</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>40</span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">寫hō͘學生朋友ê代誌</span></h3><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">陳&nbsp; &nbsp; 雷</span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tân Lûi<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/10/e_89.html\" target=\"_blank\">台灣精神——台灣新國家運動ê盲點</a></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/10/e_89.html\" target=\"_blank\">Tâi-oân Cheng-sîn — Tâi-oân Sin Kok-ka Ūn-tōng ê Bông-tiám</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>44</span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><br /></div></div></div></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><div><span><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><div style=\"font-size: x-l